{"classified_as":[{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033799","label":"oil paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300033618","label":"paintings (visual works)","type":"Type"},{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/object/8943","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"catalogue raisonnée number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026061"}],"content":"997","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"8943","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":"997, Catalogue Raisonné","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"non-preferred identifiers","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264273"}],"content":{"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"Cliffs, Ghost Ranch","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},{"notes":"Source of title: Whitney Archive, Downtown Gallery Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks. (Title used by the Metropolitan Museum of Art.)","title":"Red and Yellow Cliffs","type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"alternate-title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"},"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne":{"titles":[{"notes":"Source of title: backing inscription 1.","title":"Red and Yellow Cliffs Ghost Ranch","type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}},"type":"Name"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Red and Yellow Cliffs Ghost Ranch","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe","id":"actor/2","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Alfred Stieglitz Collection, Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe, 1986","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Cliffs with alternating red, yellow, and tan strata fill the frame. At the bottom and top of the cliffs, rippling hills dotted with green bushes stretch across the composition. Small slivers of blue sky are visible above the cliffs.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"24 x 36 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on canvas, 24 x 36 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"selected_references","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/selected_references"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Georgia O'Keeffe. New York, 1976, pl. 94. \n \nLisa M. Messinger in \"Twentieth Century Art.\" Recent Acquisitions: A Selection, 1987–1988. New York, 1988, pp. 60–61, ill. (color). \n \nLisa Mintz Messinger. Georgia O'Keeffe. New York, 1988, pp. 80, 82–83, fig. 60. \n \nLisa M. Messinger in The Landscape in Twentieth-Century American Art: Selections from The Metropolitan Museum of Art. Exh. cat., American Federation of Arts. New York, 1991, pp. 27–29, no. 4, ill. (color). \n \nLowery Stokes Sims in The Landscape in Twentieth-Century American Art: Selections from The Metropolitan Museum of Art. Exh. cat., American Federation of Arts. New York, 1991, p. 18. \n \nRobert Rosenblum in The Landscape in Twentieth-Century American Art: Selections from The Metropolitan Museum of Art. Exh. cat., American Federation of Arts. New York, 1991, p. 10. \n \nJohn Brandenburg. \"Art Review: Philbrook Show Features 60 Landscape Paintings.\" Daily Oklahoman (May 29, 1991), p. 13. \n \nEliot Nusbaum. \"Joslyn Hosts a Vivid Landscape Show.\" Des Moines Sunday Register (September 22, 1991), p. 7F. \n \nMary Ann Marger. \"An Artistic Tribute to America.\" Tampa Bay Times (January 17, 1992), p. 32. \n \nMaria Costantino. Georgia O'Keeffe. New York, 1994, pp. 132–33, ill. \n \nBarbara Buhler Lynes. Georgia O'Keeffe: Catalogue Raisonné. New Haven, Conn., 1999, vol. 1, pp. 630–31, no. 997, ill. \n \nLisa Mintz Messinger. Georgia O'Keeffe. London, 2001, pp. 142–43, fig. 92. \n \nBarbara Buhler Lynes with Russell Bowman. O'Keeffe's O'Keeffes: The Artist's Collection. Exh. cat., Milwaukee Art Museum. New York, 2001, p. 170 (app. 3: \"Works Named as Bequests in O'Keeffe's 1979 Will\"). \n \nLisa Mintz Messinger in Stieglitz and His Artists: Matisse to O'Keeffe. The Alfred Stieglitz Collection in The Metropolitan Museum of Art. Ed. Lisa Mintz Messinger. Exh. cat., The Metropolitan Museum of Art. New York, 2011, pp. 14, 205, 282, no. 192, ill. (color). \n \n\"My Country.\" Apollo 184 (October 2016), p. 119, fig. 3 (color).","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Red and Yellow Cliffs Ghost Ranch, 1940. Oil on canvas, 24 x 36 inches. Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met). Alfred Stieglitz Collection, Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe, 1986. © Metropolitan Museum of Art (The Met)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Red and Yellow Cliffs Ghost Ranch, 1940","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive indicates, \"Exam. at Amer. Place, March 1946. . . . No signature\" [notes backing inscription 1]. Abiquiú Notebooks notes backing inscriptions 1–3. The O'Keeffe–Halpert correspondence at Archive of American Art indicates that O'Keeffe decided to varnish her works on her own in the 1960s; \"My First Effort\" in inscription 3 may refer in some way to her doing so, but the exact meaning of the phrase is not clear. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on canvas","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"The artist (1940–d. 1986; her bequest as part of the Alfred Stieglitz Collection to MMA) (Source: The Met, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/884933/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/884933"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}